cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Ballistic"
abstract: >-
  Ballistic is a C++23 orbit propagation library with Python bindings, built
  for predicting where a satellite will be over the next few hours as
  precisely as the force models allow and for estimating the accelerations
  that those models miss.
authors:
  - family-names: "Huynh"
    given-names: "Nen Van"
version: "0.1.3"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nvhuynh16/ballistic"
keywords:
  - astrodynamics
  - orbit propagation
  - orbit determination
  - satellite
